---
---
<div class="data-flow">
    <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="step-icon">📄</div>
        <div class="step-content">
            <h4>Raw Inputs</h4>
            <p>Galloway VIT (Vital Statistics) & POP (Census) Excel files (1862–1914).</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-arrow">↓</div>
    <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="step-icon">🐍</div>
        <div class="step-content">
            <h4>Harmonization</h4>
            <p>Custom Python pipeline standardizes inconsistent column names and county codes.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-arrow">↓</div>
    <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="step-icon">🔗</div>
        <div class="step-content">
            <h4>Dataset Merge</h4>
            <p>Integration with iPEHD (Becker-Woessmann) for baseline religious and economic data.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-arrow">↓</div>
    <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="step-icon">📊</div>
        <div class="step-content">
            <h4>Analysis Panel</h4>
            <p>Final Parquet dataset: 12,000+ observations across 452 Prussian counties.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    .data-flow {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 1rem;
        margin: 4rem 0;
    }

    .flow-step {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 2rem;
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding: 2rem;
        border-radius: 8px;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 600px;
        transition: transform 0.3s;
    }

    .flow-step:hover {
        transform: scale(1.02);
        border-color: var(--accent);
    }

    .step-icon {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        background: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.05);
        width: 80px;
        height: 80px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        border-radius: 50%;
        border: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2);
    }

    .step-content h4 {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        color: var(--accent);
    }

    .step-content p {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        margin-bottom: 0;
        opacity: 0.7;
    }

    .flow-arrow {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        color: var(--accent);
        opacity: 0.5;
    }
</style>
